[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nine Decades of Oscar-Winning Scores (1934–2026)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --gold: #C9A84C;
    --gold-light: #F0D080;
    --gold-dim: #8B7035;
    --dark: #0D0D0D;
    --dark-card: #141414;
    --dark-surface: #1A1A1A;
    --dark-border: #2A2A2A;
    --text-primary: #F0EDE6;
    --text-secondary: #A09880;
    --text-muted: #6B6355;
    --accent-blue: #4A90C4;
    --accent-teal: #4ABFBF;
    --accent-rose: #C4607A;
    --font-serif: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --font-sans: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial', sans-serif;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    background-color: var(--dark);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ─── HEADER ─────────────────────────────────── */
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1A1400 0%, #0D0D0D 60%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
    padding: 60px 40px 48px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% -10%, rgba(201,168,76,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: normal;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  header h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
  .header-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ─── LAYOUT ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  section {
    padding: 56px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }
  section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .section-num {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    min-width: 28px;
  }
  .section-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    font-weight: normal;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* ─── KPI CARDS ──────────────────────────────── */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--dark-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .kpi-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(201,168,76,0.05) 0%, transparent 100%);
    border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 44px;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .kpi-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ─── PROSE ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .prose {
    max-width: 740px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .prose strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
  .prose em { color: var(--gold-light); font-style: normal; }

  /* ─── CHART CONTAINERS ───────────────────────── */
  .chart-wrap {
    background: var(--dark-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* ─── BAR CHART (horizontal) ─────────────────── */
  .bar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 9px;
  }
  .bar-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    width: 180px;
    min-width: 180px;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .bar-track {
    flex: 1;
    height: 24px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-radius: 3px;
    position: relative;
    min-width: 200px;
  }
  .bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-dim) 0%, var(--gold) 100%);
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }
  .bar-fill.secondary {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2A4A6B 0%, var(--accent-blue) 100%);
  }
  .bar-fill.tertiary {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1A5050 0%, var(--accent-teal) 100%);
  }
  .bar-val {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px; top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .bar-suffix {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    width: 80px;
  }

  /* ─── DECADE GRID ─────────────────────────────── */
  .decade-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .decade-card {
    background: var(--dark-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .decade-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }
  .decade-label {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .decade-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .decade-composer-list { list-style: none; }
  .decade-composer-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 3px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }
  .decade-composer-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .dc-name { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .dc-wins {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* ─── ERA CARDS ──────────────────────────────── */
  .era-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .era-card {
    background: var(--dark-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .era-stripe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
  }
  .era-card.golden .era-stripe { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8B6914, #F0D080, #8B6914); }
  .era-card.silver .era-stripe { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4A6B8B, #A0C0E0, #4A6B8B); }
  .era-card.modern .era-stripe { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3A6B4A, #80C09A, #3A6B4A); }
  .era-card.contemporary .era-stripe { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6B3A5A, #C07090, #6B3A5A); }
  .era-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .era-years {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .era-stat {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .era-stat strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .era-dominant {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .era-dominant strong { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ─── MILESTONES TABLE ───────────────────────── */
  .milestone-list { list-style: none; }
  .milestone-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }
  .milestone-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .milestone-year {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .milestone-content { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .milestone-content strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .milestone-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  /* ─── TIMELINE CHART ─────────────────────────── */
  .timeline-svg-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* ─── TAKEAWAYS ──────────────────────────────── */
  .takeaway-list { list-style: none; counter-reset: tk; }
  .takeaway-item {
    counter-increment: tk;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }
  .takeaway-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .takeaway-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .takeaway-num::before { content: counter(tk); }
  .takeaway-body { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .takeaway-body strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .takeaway-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  /* ─── TABLE ──────────────────────────────────── */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  th {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
  }
  td {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
  td.gold { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; }
  td.primary { color: var(--text-primary); }

  /* ─── NAV ────────────────────────────────────── */
  nav.toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(13,13,13,0.96);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  nav.toc ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  nav.toc a {
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  nav.toc a:hover { color: var(--gold); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }

  /* ─── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────────── */
  footer {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    header { padding: 40px 20px 32px; }
    .section-header h2 { font-size: 20px; }
    .bar-label { width: 120px; min-width: 120px; font-size: 11px; }
    .kpi-value { font-size: 36px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════ HEADER ═══════════════ -->
<header>
  <div class="header-eyebrow">Academy Awards · Best Original Score · Historical Analysis</div>
  <h1>Nine Decades of <span>Oscar-Winning Scores</span></h1>
  <p class="header-sub">A comprehensive analysis of every Best Original Score winner across 93 ceremonies, from the 6th Academy Awards (1934) to the 98th ceremony (2026). Who dominated, how styles evolved, and what the numbers reveal.</p>
  <div class="header-meta">1934 – 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 93 Ceremonies &nbsp;·&nbsp; Source: AMPAS Official Records via Kaggle/ActarusLab</div>
</header>

<!-- ═══════════════ NAV ═══════════════ -->
<nav class="toc">
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="#top-composers">Top Composers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#temporal">Temporal Patterns</a></li>
    <li><a href="#era">Era Analysis</a></li>
    <li><a href="#milestones">Milestones</a></li>
    <li><a href="#conclusions">Takeaways</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- ═══════════════ SECTION 1: OVERVIEW ═══════════════ -->
<section id="overview">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2>Dataset Overview &amp; Historical Context</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">93</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Ceremonies</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">1934 through 2026. One winner per year, consolidated from category variations over time.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">79</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Unique Composers</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">Distinct individuals credited across all wins, including composers in shared-win entries.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">4</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Maximum Wins</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">The all-time record, jointly held by John Barry, John Williams, and Ludwig Göransson.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">28%</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Repeat Winner Rate</div>
        <div class="kpi-desc">26 of 93 ceremonies were won by a composer who had already won at least once before.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      The Academy Award for Best Original Score was first presented at the <strong>6th Academy Awards in 1934</strong>, awarded to Louis Silvers for <em>One Night of Love</em>. Over the nine decades since, the category has tracked the arc of Hollywood music itself — from the lavish orchestral tapestries of the Golden Age studio system through the electronic experiments of the 1970s and 1980s, and into today's era of global sonic vocabularies.
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
